# NOTE: mlruns/, mlflow.db, catboost_info/, and models/*.joblib are
# intentionally NOT ignored in this project — they are committed and
# pushed to GitHub so the repo is fully reproducible without retraining,
# and so CI/CD can exercise the real trained model. This is a deliberate
# repo-size-for-simplicity tradeoff, not an oversight.

# ---- Docker ----
